<heading>edit - Rename a category.</heading>

<rule/>

<heading level="2">
Usage
</heading>

<pre>
  edit CATEGORY --new-name NAME
</pre>

<heading level="2">
Description
</heading>

<paragraph>
Renames a category. CATEGORY may be an id or a category name.
The new name must not collide with another category
(case-insensitive).
</paragraph>

<heading level="2">
Examples
</heading>

<pre>
edit Geschichte --new-name History
  Rename the category Geschichte to History.
</pre>

<heading level="2">
See also
</heading>

<paragraph>
add, delete, list, find
</paragraph>
